  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-256-306"><seg source="#source-256-262">水の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-262-277"><rb>辺</rb><rt>ほと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-277-283">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283-298"><rb>零</rb><rt>こぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-298-306">れる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-306-352"><seg source="#source-306-324">響ない真昼の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-324-345"><rb>樹魂</rb><rt>こだま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-345-352">。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-352-384"><seg source="#source-352-384">物のおもひの降り注ぐ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-384-406"><seg source="#source-384-406">はてしなさ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-406-438"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-406-418"><rb>充</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-418-438">ちて消えゆく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-438-475"><seg source="#source-438-450">もだしの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-450-465"><rb>応</rb><rt>こた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-465-475">へ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-475-522"><seg source="#source-475-522">水のほとりに生もなく死もなく、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-522-539"><seg source="#source-522-539">声ない歌、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-539-559"><seg source="#source-539-559">書かれぬ詩、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-559-626"><seg source="#source-559-571">いづれか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-571-589"><rb>美</rb><rt>うるは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-589-626">しからぬ自らがあらう？</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-626-676"><seg source="#source-626-676">たまたま過ぎる人の姿、獣のかげ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-676-716"><seg source="#source-676-716">それは皆遠くへ行くのだ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-716-724"><seg source="#source-716-724">色、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-724-741"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-724-736"><rb>香</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-736-741">、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-741-752"><seg source="#source-741-752">光り、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-752-785"><seg source="#source-752-767">永遠に続く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767-782"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-782-785">。</seg></p>
    </body>
